<section class="ff-warranty" id="ff-warranty-returns">
  <div class="ff-warranty__atmosphere" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="ff-warranty__inner">
    <header class="ff-warranty__header">
      <p class="ff-warranty__eyebrow">Fortune Forged</p>
      <h1 class="ff-warranty__heading">Warranty &amp; Returns</h1>
      <p class="ff-warranty__intro">Lifetime limited coverage on structure. One-year coverage on powder-coated finishes. Built for strength—and backed by the team that forged them.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="ff-warranty__highlights">
      <div class="ff-warranty__highlight">
        <p class="ff-warranty__highlight-label">Structural</p>
        <h2 class="ff-warranty__highlight-title">Lifetime Limited Warranty</h2>
        <p class="ff-warranty__highlight-text">Fortune Forged wheels are warranted free from defects in materials and workmanship for as long as the original purchaser owns them.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ff-warranty__highlight">
        <p class="ff-warranty__highlight-label">Finish</p>
        <h2 class="ff-warranty__highlight-title">1-Year Finish Coverage</h2>
        <p class="ff-warranty__highlight-text">Powder-coated finishes are covered for one year from purchase against defects under normal driving conditions with proper care.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ff-warranty__sections">
      <article class="ff-warranty__section">
        <h2 class="ff-warranty__section-title">Our Commitment</h2>
        <div class="ff-warranty__section-body">
          <p>Fortune Forged Wheels was built to raise the standard in forged wheel design, strength, and customer experience. Forged wheels are widely recognized as safer, stronger, and more durable than conventional cast wheels. We stand behind every set we produce—delivering not only exceptional products, but exceptional service through our team and authorized partners.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="ff-warranty__section">
        <h2 class="ff-warranty__section-title">Warranty Coverage</h2>
        <div class="ff-warranty__section-body">
          <p>This Lifetime Limited Warranty applies only to the original purchaser and is non-transferable. Proof of purchase is required for all warranty claims—please retain your original invoice.</p>
          <p>Fortune Forged Wheels warrants that its wheels will be free from defects in materials and workmanship for as long as the original purchaser owns the wheels (beginning on the delivery date). At our discretion, any wheel determined to be defective under warranty guidelines will be repaired or replaced.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="ff-warranty__section">
        <h2 class="ff-warranty__section-title">Finish Warranty</h2>
        <div class="ff-warranty__section-body">
          <p>Powder-coated finishes are warranted to the original purchaser for one (1) year from the date of purchase against defects under normal driving conditions, including standard paved roads and typical weather exposure. Regular cleaning and maintenance are required to preserve the finish warranty, especially in climates where road salt or chemicals are used.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="ff-warranty__section">
        <h2 class="ff-warranty__section-title">Care &amp; Maintenance</h2>
        <div class="ff-warranty__section-body">
          <ul>
            <li>Use only mild soap, water, and a soft non-abrasive cloth.</li>
            <li>Do not use chemical cleaners, harsh solutions, or spray-on wheel acids.</li>
            <li>Allow wheels to cool before cleaning; avoid washing when hot.</li>
            <li>Clean in shaded conditions whenever possible.</li>
            <li>Polished finishes require regular polishing to maintain luster.</li>
            <li>Some automated car washes and cleaning agents may damage finishes and should be avoided.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="ff-warranty__section">
        <h2 class="ff-warranty__section-title">Proper Installation</h2>
        <div class="ff-warranty__section-body">
          <p>Warranty coverage requires proper installation on the vehicle specified at the time of order, using the correct hardware and tire sizes. Wheels must be installed according to the provided specifications and industry standards.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Test-fit wheels before mounting tires to verify clearances.</li>
            <li>Follow tire manufacturer rim width recommendations.</li>
            <li>Confirm proper stud length and hardware fitment.</li>
            <li>Do not use spacers; if used, installer/end user assumes all responsibility.</li>
            <li>Torque lug hardware in a star pattern using manufacturer specifications.</li>
            <li>Re-check clearances and wheel rotation before driving.</li>
            <li>Re-torque lug hardware after 25 miles and again at 100 miles.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="ff-warranty__section">
        <h2 class="ff-warranty__section-title">Warranty Exclusions</h2>
        <div class="ff-warranty__section-body">
          <ul>
            <li>Wheels not purchased through an authorized dealer</li>
            <li>Damage caused by abuse, misuse, negligence, or accidents</li>
            <li>Damage from racing, competition, off-road use, or road hazards</li>
            <li>Damage caused by improper accessories or installation</li>
            <li>Wheels that have been modified or repaired</li>
            <li>Cosmetic blemishes on the backside of the wheel (finish coverage applies to the visible face only)</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Any refinishing, welding, machining, or structural repair performed by anyone other than Fortune Forged Wheels will void the warranty and may compromise safety.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="ff-warranty__section">
        <h2 class="ff-warranty__section-title">Order Policy</h2>
        <div class="ff-warranty__section-body">
          <p>All forged wheel orders are custom-built and final. Cancellations or changes may be subject to a minimum $100 order cancellation fee. Orders cancelled after shipment are responsible for all shipping charges plus a 20% restocking fee. Custom and special-order wheels are not eligible for returns, cancellations, or exchanges.</p>
          <p>Fortune Forged Wheels is not responsible for installation costs, transportation, downtime, or loss of vehicle use related to any warranty claim. Warranty returns determined not to qualify for coverage will be returned at the sender’s expense without repair or replacement.</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="ff-warranty__section">
        <h2 class="ff-warranty__section-title">Returns &amp; Cancellations</h2>
        <div class="ff-warranty__section-body">
          <p><strong>All sales final — built to order.</strong> All Fortune Forged wheel orders are custom manufactured. Orders cannot be cancelled, returned, or exchanged once production has started.</p>
          <p>Returns are accepted only in the following circumstances:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>The product arrives damaged due to shipping (must be reported immediately upon delivery and prior to installation), or</li>
            <li>A verified manufacturing defect is identified and approved under warranty guidelines.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Returns or exchanges will not be accepted for incorrect orders placed by the customer, damage caused after installation or use, or improper installation or misuse. Customers are responsible for confirming all vehicle specifications, sizing, finishes, and order details prior to submitting payment.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <p class="ff-warranty__footnote">This warranty is provided in lieu of all other expressed warranties. Any implied warranties, including merchantability or fitness for a particular purpose, are limited to the duration of this warranty. Fortune Forged Wheels does not authorize any representative or dealer to assume additional liability on its behalf. We reserve the right to update product designs, materials, or specifications without obligation to modify previously manufactured products.</p>

    <div class="ff-warranty__cta">
      <a class="ff-warranty__cta-btn" href="mailto:fortuneforgedwheels@gmail.com">Contact support</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
